{"id":"wb-7-1547","name":"水泉石窟","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"水泉石窟","text":"水泉石窟是位于中国河南省洛阳市寇店镇水泉村南、万安山崖壁上的佛教石窟。石窟利用天然溶洞扩凿而成，窟门向西，主壁两尊并列的立佛分置于岩壁裂隙两侧，周围分布有大小造像龛。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B0%B4%E6%B3%89%E7%9F%B3%E7%AA%9F","revisionId":95023301,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95023301","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":null}